OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786006084
OL,3,CWhich roads are closed during the
OL,4,CEuropean Athletics Championships 2026?
OL,6,FThe European Athletics Championships
OL,7,Fhas announced a series of road
OL,8,Fclosures to be made during the
OL,9,Fcompetition.
OL,11,FThe 2026 competition takes place in
OL,12,FBirmingham over seven days. Between
OL,13,FMonday, 10 August 2026 to Sunday, 16
OL,14,FAugust 2026, Perry Barr's Alexander
OL,15,FStadium will take centre stage.
OL,17,FThe competition will also play out on
OL,18,Froads throughout the city centre
OL,19,Fbetween Friday, 14 August and Sunday,
OL,20,F16 August.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
