OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786006084
OL,3,CWhich roads are closed during the
OL,4,CEuropean Athletics Championships 2026?
OL,6,FThis will be for the Marathon, the
OL,7,FRace Walk, the Unity Challenge 1K and
OL,8,Fthe 5K mass participation events.
OL,10,FA number of Team GB's key athletes
OL,11,Fwill be competing very close-to-home,
OL,12,Fas they are based across the Midlands.
OL,14,FThese include Wolverhampton-born
OL,15,FMatthew Hudson-Smith, who had a
OL,16,Ftemporary stand at the Alexander
OL,17,FStadium named after him.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786006084
OL,3,CWhich roads are closed during the
OL,4,CEuropean Athletics Championships 2026?
OL,6,FIt also includes Coventry's Godiva
OL,7,FHarriers 400m hurdler Jake Minshull
OL,8,Fand Lincoln Wellington A.C. runner
OL,9,FAbbie Donnelly.
OL,11,FShe'll be competing in the Women's
OL,12,FMarathon event on the morning of
OL,13,FSunday, 16 August - when there will be
OL,14,Fthe most amount of roads closed.
OL,16,FHowever, some of Birmingham's busiest
OL,17,Froads will be closed on Friday and
OL,18,FSaturday, including Colmore Row and
OL,19,FTemple Row (Saturday, 15 August).
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
