OL,3,CWhich roads are closed during the
OL,4,CEuropean Athletics Championships 2026?
OL,6,FParking restrictions will also start
OL,7,Fjust before midnight (23:59), the day
OL,8,Fbefore road closures for the following
OL,9,Fday.
OL,11,FThe Championships has warned that "any
OL,12,Fvehicles left on the the event routes
OL,13,Fafter these times may be moved by our
OL,14,Frelocation system and could receive a
OL,15,Fpenalty charge notice."
OL,17,FPassengers have been advised to used
OL,18,Fdriveways or park on nearby side
OL,19,Fstreets.
OL,21,FRoad Closures on Friday 14 August 2026
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
